    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Turn-based battles with a simultaneous system of moves </h2><br>Two players using their elementals must destroy the enemy base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283490/extras/0ae70e30522d6ef15ba7bfb4d0e2b9a6.poster.avif?t=1716448151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283490/extras/0ae70e30522d6ef15ba7bfb4d0e2b9a6.webm?t=1716448151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283490/extras/0ae70e30522d6ef15ba7bfb4d0e2b9a6.mp4?t=1716448151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Select an elemental</strong>, order it to move or attack, select the next one.. and <strong>finish your turn</strong>. At this time, your opponent will also choose actions for his elementals and the battle will begin! Destroy the enemy's base to win.<br><br>Using the <strong>Main</strong> system, each player will have priority in battle, use this to predict the behavior of the enemy.<br><br><strong>Get Hexes</strong> (coins) every turn and spend them.<br><br>Actions are available to you:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create a new Elemental<br></li><li> Add life to your Elemental<br></li><li> Destroy the enemy elemental<br></li><li> Freezing<br></li><li> Elemental Teleportation<br></li><li> Wall</li></ul><br>The number of features will increase as the game progresses",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Turn-based battles with a simultaneous system of moves </h2><br>Two players using their elementals must destroy the enemy base.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283490/extras/0ae70e30522d6ef15ba7bfb4d0e2b9a6.poster.avif?t=1716448151\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283490/extras/0ae70e30522d6ef15ba7bfb4d0e2b9a6.webm?t=1716448151\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2283490/extras/0ae70e30522d6ef15ba7bfb4d0e2b9a6.mp4?t=1716448151\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Select an elemental</strong>, order it to move or attack, select the next one.. and <strong>finish your turn</strong>. At this time, your opponent will also choose actions for his elementals and the battle will begin! Destroy the enemy's base to win.<br><br>Using the <strong>Main</strong> system, each player will have priority in battle, use this to predict the behavior of the enemy.<br><br><strong>Get Hexes</strong> (coins) every turn and spend them.<br><br>Actions are available to you:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Create a new Elemental<br></li><li> Add life to your Elemental<br></li><li> Destroy the enemy elemental<br></li><li> Freezing<br></li><li> Elemental Teleportation<br></li><li> Wall</li></ul><br>The number of features will increase as the game progresses",
